< 4/2.2 = 1.8182pt`嚥?**r????덊뀋??*\\r\\n    //     獄쏄퀣??? ?얜떯?????? ??뚮뮞筌?5?봔??疫꼲???誘れ뵠??4.26~14.16pt??????r\\n    //     ?紐꾪뀱?봔?癒?퐣????용┛筌왖 筌륁궢釉?? ?⑥쥙??4pt嚥???롫즼?귐됥늺 ??苡??獄쏆꼶?嚥?\\n    //     ?リ낱??獄쏄퀣??0.5)??h??pt ?袁ⓦ늺?癒?퐣 ???럮嚥??醫롫뻼??뺣뼄.\\r\\n    // (2) 筌왖??野껉퍔????덈뼄??揶쎛???癒?퍥揶쎛 ??쇰??癒?퐣 ?얜?瑗ワ쭪袁⑤뼄. ??곕립 ?醫뤾쿃??????r\\n    //     pdf.js ?袁⑹뵠??뽰몵嚥?筌잛눊而???臾? ??? 揶쏄쑨爰????ㅻ뮉????????꾨????쇰퓠\\r\\n    //     ??쇱삺??뺣뼄 ??yokohama-p14 y??15.84????50x1000??우뵠 `650`夷?x`夷?1`夷?000`\\r\\n    //     ???袁⑹뵠??뽰몵嚥???ㅻ뼄. 域밸챶???**?븐늿肉????揶쏄쑨爰?`1`??000`)??揶쏅뜄?????\\n    //     揶쏄쑨爰?`650`??x`, `x`??1`)???袁? ?類μ넇??4.9770pt嚥?揶쏆늾??** ??堉???묐립??\\n    //     ??륁뱽 揶쎛?쒕똻? 筌륁궢釉??????000??우뱽 ?????揶쏅?? ???000??얜즲 ??ｍ뜞 筌띾슢諭??\\r\\n    //     ??묐립??筌왖??????됰????醫롮뵬????뿅???癒?봺?怨몄몵嚥?筌왖??????용뮉 野껉퍔???\\r\\n    //\\r\\n    // 揶쏆늿? ?袁⑹뵠????됱벥 疫꼲?癒?뮉 揶쏄쑨爰??**?類μ넇??0**????toTextItems揶쎛\\r\\n    // `x = ?癒?젎 + characterWidth*index`嚥??蹂ㅽ?域?characterWidth??w嚥??節뗫뮉??.\\r\\n    // 域밸챶??????얜챸苑??揶쎛?쒕???野껉퍔? ?紐꾩젫???袁⑹뵠??**????*??욱? ?얜챸苑???リ낱??????벥\\r\\n    // ??쎈솭??癰귣쵑鍮???袁⑤빍???브쑬????筌왖??沅∽쭪? ??꾪?椰꾧퀣???롫뮉 筌잛럩???\\r\\n    const threshold = previous ? Math.min(previous.h, item.h) * gapRatio : 0\\r\\n\\r\\n    if (!group || !previous || item.x - (previous.x + previous.w) > threshold) {\\r\\n      groups.push([item])\\r\\n    } else {\\r\\n      group.push(item)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  return groups.map((group) => {\\r\\n    const text = group.map((item) => item.str).join('')\\r\\n    // ?硫몃젃?믪눛???獄쏅뗄???獄쏅벡?ゆ에?x夷똢ndX夷똠enterY???怨뺣뼄(y??甕곗쥙???살뵬?紐꾩뵠??疫꼲??\\n    // ??롪돌??[y-h, y] ?닌덉퍢). spread(Math.min(...)/Math.max(...))??????????\\n    // ?紐꾩쁽 ??? 疫꼲?귐뗫늄 ??? 域밸챶?嚥??怨뺤뵬揶쎛 ??쎄문 ??뺣즲?癒?퐣 RangeError揶쎛 ??뺣뼄\\r\\n    // (verticalRuns??flush()?? 揶쏆늿? ??곸?. x夷똢ndX????甕?????곸?嚥??⑥쥙?쒙쭪?\\n    // centerY ??곷퓠 spread??筌?쑬以???λ툡 ??됰?????#32 ??곸뜞 筌왖??(b)).\\r\\n    let x = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\\r\\n    let endX = Number.NEGATIVE_INFINITY\\r\\n    let top = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\\r\\n    let bottom = Number.NEGATIVE_INFINITY\\r\\n    for (const item of group) {\\r\\n      if (item.x < x) x = item.x\\r\\n      if (item.x + item.w > endX) endX = item.x + item.w\\r\\n      if (item.y - item.h < top) top = item.y - item.h\\r\\n      if (item.y > bottom) bottom = item.y\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    return {\\r\\n      text,\\r\\n      compact: compact(text),\\r\\n      items: group,\\r\\n      x,\\r\\n      endX,\\r\\n      centerX: (x + endX) / 2,\\r\\n      centerY: (top + bottom) / 2,\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  })\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nexport function recoverRows(items: TextItem[], gapRatio?: number): TextRow[] {\\r\\n  const rows: Array<Omit<TextRow, 'segments'>> = []\\r\\n  const horizontalItems = items\\r\\n    .filter(\\r\\n      (item) =>\\r\\n        item.str.trim().length > 0 &&\\r\\n        (item.rot === undefined || Math.abs(item.rot) < ROTATION_TOLERANCE_DEG),\\r\\n    )\\r\\n    .sort((left, right) => left.y - right.y || left.x - right.x)\\r\\n\\r\\n  for (const item of horizontalItems) {\\r\\n    let closest: Omit<TextRow, 'segments'> | undefined\\r\\n    let closestDistance = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\\r\\n\\r\\n    for (const row of rows) {\\r\\n      const distance = Math.abs(row.y - item.y)\\r\\n      const tolerance = Math.max(1, Math.min(row.height, item.h) * 0.3)\\r\\n      if (distance <= tolerance && distance < closestDistance) {\\r\\n        closest = row\\r\\n        closestDistance = distance\\r\\n      }\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    if (closest) {\\r\\n      closest.items.push(item)\\r\\n      closest.y =\\r\\n        closest.items.reduce((total, rowItem) => total + rowItem.y, 0) /\\r\\n        closest.items.length\\r\\n      closest.height = Math.max(closest.height, item.h)\\r\\n    } else {\\r\\n      rows.push({ y: item.y, height: item.h, items: [item] })\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  return rows\\r\\n    .sort((left, right) => left.y - right.y)\\r\\n    .map((row) => ({ ...row, segments: makeSegments(row.items, gapRatio) }))\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n/**